## TCG-VAULT SC DualDefense Audit

I participated in the **TCG-VAULT SC DualDefense Audit Contest** on HackenProof as a smart contract security researcher.

As part of the contest, I analyzed the in-scope smart contracts and submitted security reports through the official platform.

Although my submitted findings were **not accepted**, the contest provided practical experience in:

* Smart contract security analysis
* Identifying and validating potential vulnerabilities
* Writing reproducible security reports
* Understanding vulnerability classification and triage feedback
* Improving findings based on reviewer feedback

> This repository documents my participation and learning experience. Contest findings and triage communications are not reproduced here.
